
What does a 32 bit CPU need?

32 general purpose register
Intermediate Register
32 bit compatible ALU
Branch comparison logic unit, could be within ALU
32 bit program counter
Control Unit (multicycle version)
Instruction memory/Data memory - might be together since multicycle
instruction decoder
Instruction set (This probably need to be a traditional one)
flags
Write back program


Register file:

traditional 32 bit architecture


x0	zero	Hardwired zero	—
x1	ra	Return address for subroutines	Caller
x2	sp	Stack pointer	Callee
x3	gp	Global pointer	—
x4	tp	Thread pointer	—
x5–x7	t0–t2	Temporary registers	Caller
x8	s0 / fp	Saved register 0 / Frame pointer	Callee
x9	s1	Saved register 1	Callee
x10–x11	a0–a1	Function arguments / Return values	Caller
x12–x17	a2–a7	Function arguments	Caller
x18–x27	s2–s11	Saved registers	Callee
x28–x31	t3–t6	Temporary registers	Caller
